NAME
       tables - table forms and width fitting

CAP
       A short column and two long ones; only the long ones give up width.
        abcdef   twelve-chars twelve-chars and more words to         fourteen-chars fourteen-chars more words until the
                 thirty                                              cell reaches fifty

ALLBOX
                                             --------+----------------------------
                                              NUMBER            CENTERED
                                             --------+----------------------------
                                                   1              one
                                             --------+----------------------------
                                                  22           twenty two
                                             --------+----------------------------
                                                 333   three hundred thirty three
                                             --------+----------------------------

WIDTH
        key            a column with a minimum width of twelve

RECORDS
        supercalifragilistic   antidisestablishmentarianism   floccinaucinihilipilification   pneumonoultramicroscopic

LITERAL IN A DEFINITION
       -e expr
              srt -e 'one'
              srt -e 'two'

       -v     verbose.
